  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_039 (0.725 accuracy) is the top performer with scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests scgpt RNA (a more advanced encoder) with the same image encoder and weighted fusion, but with avgpool aggregation. It clarifies whether switching to scgpt RNA (potentially higher capacity) could improve accuracy while keeping costs moderate. The expected cost is ~5.5 GPU hours, balancing exploration of a promising encoder with computational efficiency."
